Boundaries and gaps
- No native parser, lowerer, sanitizer, bxl writer, watcher, live switch, dictionary or ATIF exporter is claimed in P1. P2/P7/P8 product contracts are explicitly deferred in verification/README.md.
- No Yarn runtime/topology exists yet; the constrained finite Rust checker API exports TLA+ and compares Java parity. This is not a full TLC replacement or arbitrary Rust refinement proof.
- Decoded::encode preserves future fields/tags. Decoded::into_value deliberately extracts only the known v0.1 projection and discards extensions, as documented.
- The deny check detects package identities/origins and declared copying. Unattributed copied implementations still require source review. No denied implementation code was read or reused.
