- A concurrent P0 worker replaced Makefile in the original shared checkout. P1 was isolated into the worktree above; probes/ is excluded from this commit. Original-checkout copies were left intact.
- Every fixture is synthetic; no real session contents or credentials are committed.
- Every new source carries the ATTRIBUTION.md policy header. Adapted formal infrastructure carries upstream origin/license notices beside the implementation.

