  sorted lexicographically; duplicate-key rejection compares those same bytes.
  The length-first CanonicalValue comparator is removed.
- tests/cbor_compat.rs:262 — fixed byte vector for RFC 8949 §4.2.1's eight mixed
  key types; this independently distinguishes bytewise from length-first order.
  Primary reference: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8949.html#section-4.2.1
- tests/cbor_golden.rs:239/243 and tests/fixtures/ir-v0.1.hex — goldens deliberately
